WEBVTT

00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:07,810
Hello, this is Dr. Kevin Cutters, breast cancer like any cancer diagnosis can be very scary

00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:09,850
and it can be worrisome.

00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:16,450
And when you hear that C word, it brings out a lot of anxiety, it stimulates your sympathetic

00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:19,050
nervous system to go into fight or flight.

00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:23,890
When you hear the diagnosis, it can be very scary.

00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:33,250
Be careful, that's my first piece of advice, to slow down and to consider your options.

00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:38,050
Standards of care are going to give you very specific options, chemotherapy, radiation,

00:00:38,050 --> 00:00:45,050
surgery, and it's easy to get hurted down a pathway that you might later regret.

00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:50,170
Not that these therapies, standards of care aren't right for everybody.

00:00:50,170 --> 00:00:57,650
But you have to realize that alternative care is not exclusive from them.

00:00:57,650 --> 00:01:03,810
We have hundreds of patients that are doing some standards of care of some level, but

00:01:03,810 --> 00:01:11,050
have added on alternative care to increase the benefit of those other standards of care

00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:15,850
like chemo or radiation and to improve their outcome.

00:01:15,850 --> 00:01:21,290
When you change your diet and you do some nutritional approaches that can be very cancer-killing

00:01:21,290 --> 00:01:27,930
in themselves, improving your health, improving the health of your healthy cells, you're

00:01:27,930 --> 00:01:31,850
going to have a better outcome, it just makes sense.

00:01:31,850 --> 00:01:38,250
But when you do choose alternative care or to add on alternative care to what you're already

00:01:38,250 --> 00:01:45,050
going to do, then that also becomes confusing and we understand that my sisters, friends,

00:01:45,050 --> 00:01:51,370
brothers told me to take this or somebody at church, gave me this product, I could take

00:01:51,370 --> 00:01:57,930
or I read this on Facebook or I did research on this product, it's very confusing, it's

00:01:57,930 --> 00:02:03,290
almost like drinking from a fire hose when you start to do some research on cancer.

00:02:03,370 --> 00:02:10,650
We see as our part of your care is to help you wade through that.

00:02:10,650 --> 00:02:18,010
We do very specific testing so we can get specific on what diet, what food source is possibly

00:02:18,010 --> 00:02:20,970
fueling your cancer, let's eliminate that.

00:02:20,970 --> 00:02:26,490
What nutritional product is going to be best for you and your cancer, what's going to be the

00:02:26,490 --> 00:02:31,370
best thing to do to help support your cells, what are the best modalities to be used

00:02:31,850 --> 00:02:36,490
and with the best frequencies to be used to hold it on your cancer.

00:02:36,490 --> 00:02:42,810
Everything is very specific with what we do, ultimately we want the best outcome for you.

00:02:42,810 --> 00:02:51,450
So when you combine different things and you're really going to get the best of everything.

00:02:51,450 --> 00:02:57,530
So we're not exclusive to standards of care, but we're not always just an add on.

00:02:57,530 --> 00:03:03,130
So understand alternative care really should be something everybody should be doing.

00:03:03,130 --> 00:03:08,410
And when you do that, when you look at the big picture, when you slow down and you get your

00:03:08,410 --> 00:03:15,450
stress levels down, when you utilize somebody like us as a coach for you, that could help relieve

00:03:15,450 --> 00:03:21,450
some of the tension that goes along with a cancer diagnosis and ultimately you're going to get the

00:03:21,450 --> 00:03:27,050
best results because that's what we want for you. So look at these pages, look at our side,

00:03:27,050 --> 00:03:33,050
whether you choose to become a patient of ours, that's okay. Download all my books on this site too.

00:03:33,050 --> 00:03:39,290
It'll give you some data so that you can ground yourself and make the best decision possible.

00:03:39,290 --> 00:03:42,010
As always, we'll be praying for you.

